Modifications made by TinLabs relative to RustDesk v1.5.0 are, at minimum:
  * Application name / identifier rebranded from "RustDesk" to "TinSuporte"
    (libs/hbb_common/src/config.rs, APP_NAME) and the Windows binary name
    (flutter/windows/CMakeLists.txt, BINARY_NAME).
  * Application icon replaced (flutter/windows/runner/resources/app_icon.ico)
    and Flutter runtime assets added (flutter/assets/icon.png,
    flutter/assets/logo_dark.png; see the .gitignore exception for
    flutter/assets/**).
  * Windows version-resource metadata (company, product, copyright)
    (flutter/windows/runner/Runner.rc).
  * About-page attribution text
    (flutter/lib/desktop/pages/desktop_setting_page.dart).
  * Tab-bar window title now resolves through bind.mainGetAppNameSync()
    instead of a hard-coded "RustDesk" (flutter/lib/desktop/widgets/
    tabbar_widget.dart).
  * The default rendezvous server and default server public key were changed
    from rs-ny.rustdesk.com to the self-hosted instance tinsuporte.ddns.net
    (libs/hbb_common/src/config.rs, RENDEZVOUS_SERVERS / RS_PUB_KEY).
  * User-facing links (privacy, pricing, download, documentation) were pointed
    to https://tinlabs.pt.
  * Every translatable string containing "RustDesk" is now rewritten to the
    application name at load time (src/lang.rs).
  * TOTP issuer renamed to "TinSuporte" (src/auth_2fa.rs).

